        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "知事家族ヲ記セス"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "知事家族を記さず"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Governor's household: not recorded. This column stands to the right of the ○松本藩 marker, so it closes the block of the preceding domain, Maebashi (前橋藩), rather than opening Matsumoto's. Maebashi's fascicle-5 entry runs through upper p207 left (page 389, running head 藩制一覽表第五（前橋）) and breaks off after 穢多人口, which is the field that immediately precedes 知事家族 in this fascicle. The same field for Matsumoto prints on upper p209 right, again to the right of the next domain's marker (○丸龜藩), where it reads 知事家族 十人 内男五人女五人. MASTER files this cell under 松本藩; the marker position and the upper p209 right parallel both put it with Maebashi."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "知事家族（前橋藩分）"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p208_right.jpg",
